## Why This Is Asked

Tests understanding of per-tenant data isolation, Azure Storage SAS scope, and minimal server-side auditing in a beginner setting. It also touches Node.js SDK usage and basic security considerations without heavy infrastructure.

## Key Concepts

- Azure Storage SAS for scoped permissions
- Per-tenant folder structure in ADLS Gen2
- Lightweight auditing via blob/log container
- Time-limited tokens and basic validation

## Code Example

